Subject: [PATCH] int_trips_enriched: merge on the reporting grain

The daily mart only needs one row per pickup zone and day, so key the
incremental merge on (pickup_location_id, pickup_date) instead of trip_id.

(Demo patch: this key is not unique. The first run builds the table with
CREATE TABLE AS and every test passes; the second run is a MERGE, and
Snowflake rejects it with 100090 "Duplicate row detected during DML action".)
---
--- a/models/intermediate/int_trips_enriched.sql
+++ b/models/intermediate/int_trips_enriched.sql
@@ -2,7 +2,7 @@
     config(
         materialized='incremental',
         incremental_strategy='merge',
-        unique_key='trip_id',
+        unique_key=['pickup_location_id', 'pickup_date'],
         on_schema_change='append_new_columns'
     )
 }}
